graph\" > <strong>Unique art style</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We blended our art style with 8-way sprites and a palette worthy of the Lovecraft theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438290/extras/d6509cd06f48569cc58e122c41eef9a9.poster.avif?t=1741854592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438290/extras/d6509cd06f48569cc58e122c41eef9a9.webm?t=1741854592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438290/extras/d6509cd06f48569cc58e122c41eef9a9.mp4?t=1741854592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your gameplay style with different weapons. There are different weapons in Hanctt Origins, and these weapons are shaped according to your playing style. If you want to specialize in close combat in the game, you should tend accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438290/extras/a5c5beb48b61c2e5010fca04982b9567.poster.avif?t=1741854592\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438290/extras/a5c5beb48b61c2e5010fca04982b9567.webm?t=1741854592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438290/extras/a5c5beb48b61c2e5010fca04982b9567.mp4?t=1741854592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can add innovation to your gameplay style by unlocking special power-ups for weapons from the skill tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:/