0/extras/e0881887b5a76407795607c4dcfc8680.webm?t=1741854592\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438290/extras/e0881887b5a76407795607c4dcfc8680.mp4?t=1741854592\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bergerson shared with Gab ancient secrets and mysterious information about the continent of Hanctt. Gab took a tour around the town and reached the scene of the murder. The police were carrying out a detailed study together with the crime scene investigation team. While Lina took the lead as crime scene investigation manager, Gab made efforts to search for clues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438290/extras/4488c0c1f38de6a53ea643ae5204363f.avif?t=1741854592\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they moved towards the port under Gab's guidance, Lina noticed a glow... Gab's eyes darkened and then she found herself on the other side of the interrogation table, that is, on the criminal side. Police officers began asking him questions about the murder, but Gab was unable to answer due to the shock of the incident. His colleagues decided to expel Gab from his profession because they thought Lina had been murdered, but they did not have enough evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gab decided that the only way out was to cooperate with Bergerson and go to the Hanctt continent. On the continent of Hanctt, in the Ludtern region, his main mission focused on finding his mate. This was Gab's evolution of what was initially a simple murder investigation into a complex story that took him on a journey deep into the Hanctt continent.</p>",
